OL,3,ARAF Fairford incident involves 'foreign
OL,4,Aactor', says Rubio, as some evacuated
OL,5,Aresidents return home
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe men - all UK nationals in their 20s
OL,8,Fwho live in London - had been arrested
OL,9,Funder the Explosives Act and on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of preparing a terrorist act
OL,12,FAC Laurence Taylor, the head of UK
OL,13,Fcounter terrorism policing, has said
OL,14,Fofficers are pursuing multiple lines of
OL,15,Finquiry, including if proxies working
OL,16,Fon behalf of a foreign state could've
OL,17,Fbeen involved - the Iranian embassy in
OL,18,Fthe UK denies involvement
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
