OL,3,AEvicted Spanish pensioner can move back
OL,4,Ahome, lawyer says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbascal's lawyer, Beatriz Duro, told a
OL,7,Fpress conference there had been
OL,8,F"goodwill from both parties" and that
OL,9,Fshe would pay a similar amount of rent
OL,10,Funder a new contract, averting a
OL,11,Fsignificant price hike.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
